-- statement:
--   One importable Chat06 stopped original source negative-jump generator interface. For any signed predictable contraction (including discounted random stops), establishes true X.nu product-measure L1 integrability and L2 energy of nonlinear Ito-Meyer Taylor correction, vanishing full-negative-mark L1 and L2 energy tails, and physical time product generator drift L1 tails. Uses literal X.X prepayment left limit, source X.nu, inclusive original ruinTime and negative extension of w. No automatic physical source compensator is asserted: Chat01 hFuture is still needed, and Chat02 handles martingale isometry.
-- source:
